  "description": "Part 2 of South Park: The Stick of Truth! I'm Lelac, aka BaoChickaWowWow, and this time the New Kid (and Butters, who is honestly carrying) is out recruiting Craig, Token and Tweek for Cartman's army.\n\nAl Gore drafts me into hunting ManBearPig, a security guard pepper sprays me, we get completely wiped by elves, Craig turns out to be in detention, Kenny's house is... a lot, and we finish by taking down Genghis Khan himself.\n\nShould I keep going? Let me know what you think in the comments!\n\nIf you enjoyed it, like and subscribe so you don't miss Part 3.\n\nCHAPTERS\n{CHAPTERS}\n\n#BaoChickaWowWow #SouthPark #StickOfTruth #SouthParkStickOfTruth #LetsPlay #Gameplay #FirstPlaythrough #Part2",
